      "id": "reconstruction_rollup",
      "lane_id": "local",
      "objective": "Roll up every reconstructor's recovered-constraint record for example fog_of_war_review topic into one findings ledger. Preserve which constraints each lane reconstructed vs missed, and carry unanswered peer interrogations forward as evidence for the coverage judge.",
